backend/logs/
# Alembic migrations are versioned artifacts — they MUST be tracked, otherwise
# `alembic upgrade head` (run on deploy and in CI) finds nothing on a fresh checkout.
# (This previously ignored backend/alembic/versions/*.py, which left even the existing
# monobank migration out of the repo.)

